<h1>Debra Silverstein</h1>
<p>50th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://debrafor50.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (debrafor50.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Launched her reelection campaign in August 2026 at a West Rogers Park restaurant, joined by more than 100 community members and faith leaders. Her campaign site lists public safety, constituent services, economic development and school improvements as her issues, and says she strictly opposes any property tax hikes.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>50th Ward alderman since 2011; founded a small tax consultancy before entering politics and co-founded the Libenu Foundation, which creates supervised housing for adults with developmental disabilities.</p>
